[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Strict numeric analyzer requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-NARROWING
TITLE: SSN1001 unsafe built-in integer narrowing
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall report an explicit built-in integer conversion, including a tuple element conversion, when its source range or exact source constant is outside its target range at either supported native width. A lifted conversion of known null shall be allowed.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeConversion and NumericSymbols.IsNarrowing. Verification: Narrowing_requires_a_representable_source_range_or_a_status_boundary, All_built_in_integer_pairs_match_exact_range_containment, and Seeded_literal_casts_and_malformed_operands_use_compiler_binding in tests/SharpSafeNumerics.AnalyzerUnitTests/StrictNumericAnalyzerTests.cs.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-UNCHECKED
TITLE: SSN1002 unchecked integer arithmetic
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall report explicit unchecked contexts and nonconstant integer addition, subtraction, multiplication, negation, increment and decrement that bind to an unchecked built-in integer operation.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.Initialize and AnalyzeArithmetic. Verification: Unchecked_operations_and_explicit_overrides_follow_the_compiler_context, Strict_scope_follows_lexical_symbols_including_nested_and_async_bodies, and Alias_only_core_references_resolve_the_real_contracts.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-RESULT
TITLE: SSN1003 discarded numeric results
STATEMENT: The analyzer shall warn for detectable expression-statement and explicit discards of NumericResult values, including deconstruction and out discards, independent of strict scope.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeIgnoredResult. Verification: Discarded_results_are_warnings_in_all_scopes and Unrelated_annotations_and_generic_result_types_do_not_match.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-THROW
TITLE: SSN1004 statically known Throw policy
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall report compile-time ArithmeticPolicy.Throw values, including aliases and omitted nullable or nonnullable arguments with that default, and calls to generated arithmetic that declares Throw.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeStrict and AnalyzeInvocation, NumericSymbols.IsThrowConstant and HasThrowOverflowPolicy. Verification: Throw_policy_is_detected_when_the_bound_value_is_known and Generated_contracts_survive_assembly_boundaries.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-POLICY-CONVERSION
TITLE: SSN1005 raw saturating and truncating numeric conversion
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall report direct invocations of the generic math CreateSaturating and CreateTruncating contracts.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeInvocation and NumericSymbols.IsRawNumericConversion. Verification: Raw_generic_math_policy_conversion_requires_a_named_numeric_boundary.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-BOUNDED-ACCESS
TITLE: SSN1006 detectable bounded domain bypasses
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall report raw generated constructors and storage access, generated conversions or accessors that bypass a status-based admission or read, and known raw reinterpretation operations involving an annotated bounded domain, including nullable payloads. Name-only references shall be allowed.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeStrict, AnalyzeConversion and AnalyzeInvocation, NumericSymbols.IsBoundedGeneratedMember and IsBoundedReinterpretation. Verification: Generated_domain_can_be_bypassed_only_at_the_diagnosed_use_site and Generated_contracts_survive_assembly_boundaries.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-ALLOCATION
TITLE: SSN1007 evident managed allocation sites
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall warn at documented detectable managed allocation sites, including reference and array creation, boxing, materialized interpolated strings and capturing lambdas. Captures through statically resolved local functions shall be included.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeStrict, AnalyzeConversion, IsHandlerContent and CapturesState, NumericSymbols.IsBoxing. Verification: Evident_allocations_are_warnings_without_flagging_value_construction.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SN-013-DEFAULT
TITLE: SSN1008 invalid bounded defaults
STATEMENT: In strict scope, the analyzer shall reject explicit default construction of bounded domains configured invalid and permit default construction of bounded domains configured ZeroValid.
COMMENT: Implementation: StrictNumericAnalyzer.AnalyzeDefault and NumericSymbols.IsZeroValid. Verification: Invalid_defaults_and_zero_valid_defaults_follow_the_domain_contract and Generated_contracts_survive_assembly_boundaries.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SN-013
